{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01250","headline":"相和歌辞 上留田 · 僧贯休","name":"相和歌辞 上留田","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"父不父，兄不兄，上留田，蝥贼生。\n徒陟冈，泪峥嵘，我欲使诸凡鸟雀，尽变爲鶺鴒。\n我欲使诸凡草木，尽变爲田荆。\n邻人歌，邻人歌，古风清，清风生。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"僧贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01250.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01250","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}